TITLE Mix river water (Cl=10, pH 6.0) with seawater (Cl=19000, pH 8.1) at 0.7:0.3; get specific conductance
SOLUTION 1 River
    pH 6.0
    units mg/L
    Cl 10
SOLUTION 2 Seawater_like
    pH 8.1
    units mg/L
    Cl 19000
MIX 1
    1 0.7
    2 0.3
END
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -totals Cl
USER_PUNCH
    -headings SpCond_uScm
10 PUNCH SC
